1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,533
In this video you will install cheats for your games, fix them after a game update,

2
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:09,667
install a system theme and make your own theme from a picture.

3
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:12,733
On the Tools tab open Game Tools, then Cheats.

4
00:00:12,733 --> 00:00:16,733
Each game's cheats are a text file named after its Build ID.

5
00:00:16,733 --> 00:00:21,333
This is a code of the game version, and it changes with every update.

6
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:24,867
So a file works only for the version it was made for.

7
00:00:24,867 --> 00:00:28,200
Kefir Hub installs, shows and deletes cheat files.

8
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:33,467
Single cheats are turned on and off in the game, with the EdiZon overlay in the

9
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:35,467
Tesla menu.

10
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:37,800
The easiest way is a complete pack.

11
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:42,933
Choose Download Kefir Cheats, or Download 60FPS/GFX Cheats for frame rate and

12
00:00:42,933 --> 00:00:44,933
graphics cheats.

13
00:00:44,933 --> 00:00:46,933
Confirm with Download.

14
00:00:46,933 --> 00:00:49,133
Wait for "Cheats pack installed".

15
00:00:49,133 --> 00:00:52,600
The pack overwrites cheat files with the same names.

16
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:57,600
Cheats for one game: choose Download Exact Cheats and the game in the list.

17
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:00,933
Tip: start the game once and close it before this.

18
00:01:00,933 --> 00:01:04,133
Kefir Hub then reads the Build ID more reliably.

19
00:01:04,133 --> 00:01:07,800
The Build ID is shown at the top next to the game name.

20
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:11,267
A ticks a cheat, X selects all, R previews the code.

21
00:01:11,267 --> 00:01:13,400
Press Y to download and confirm.

22
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:16,667
New cheats are added to the game's existing file.

23
00:01:16,667 --> 00:01:20,533
One file holds up to 128 cheats: Atmosphère reads no more.

24
00:01:20,533 --> 00:01:25,800
If you have your own cheat file, choose Import From File, then the file and the

25
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,800
game.

26
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:30,667
Kefir Hub renames it to the right Build ID.

27
00:01:30,667 --> 00:01:32,667
Confirm with Import.

28
00:01:32,667 --> 00:01:35,667
View Cheats lists every game that has cheats.

29
00:01:35,667 --> 00:01:40,867
Open a game to see its files by Build ID, and a file to see the cheats inside.

30
00:01:40,867 --> 00:01:44,000
After a game update the old file is not loaded.

31
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Focus it and press Y, Fix BID.

32
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,067
The dialog shows the old and the new Build ID.

33
00:01:49,067 --> 00:01:51,067
Confirm.

34
00:01:51,067 --> 00:01:54,933
The file is renamed, but the codes inside are not changed.

35
00:01:54,933 --> 00:01:59,200
Cheats made for an older version may not work, or may misbehave.

36
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:04,467
To delete a file, press X on it; for all cheats of a game, press Y on the game.

37
00:02:04,467 --> 00:02:09,733
Delete All Cheats removes the cheats of every game, and Delete Orphaned removes

38
00:02:09,733 --> 00:02:12,067
those of games no longer installed.

39
00:02:12,067 --> 00:02:14,067
Now themes.

40
00:02:14,067 --> 00:02:16,067
On the Tools tab open Themes.

41
00:02:16,067 --> 00:02:21,200
Kefir Hub downloads theme files, and the NXThemes Installer app applies them.

42
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:26,267
There are two ready-made packs, Mario BG Dark and Switch 2 Theme by alexwak.

43
00:02:26,267 --> 00:02:30,133
Select a pack and confirm "Download theme?" with Download.

44
00:02:30,133 --> 00:02:34,933
If NXThemes Installer is not there yet, Kefir Hub offers to download it.

45
00:02:34,933 --> 00:02:36,933
Choose Download.

46
00:02:36,933 --> 00:02:41,067
When "Theme downloaded, install now?" appears, choose Install.

47
00:02:41,067 --> 00:02:44,467
NXThemes Installer opens with the downloaded files.

48
00:02:44,467 --> 00:02:46,467
Apply the theme there.

49
00:02:46,467 --> 00:02:48,467
More themes are in Themezer.

50
00:02:48,467 --> 00:02:51,867
Each tile shows a preview, the name and the author.

51
00:02:51,867 --> 00:02:55,267
Y shows the pack's screenshots, R and L turn pages.

52
00:02:55,267 --> 00:02:59,067
Press A to download a pack, then install it the same way.

53
00:02:59,067 --> 00:03:04,467
Pressing the right stick, R3, stars the pack: it then appears in the Themes menu.

54
00:03:04,467 --> 00:03:07,333
You can make your own theme from a picture.

55
00:03:07,333 --> 00:03:12,533
Open File Browser, select an image, press Plus and choose Create Switch Theme.

56
00:03:12,533 --> 00:03:14,533
Frame the picture.

57
00:03:14,533 --> 00:03:20,000
The D-pad or a stick moves it, holding ZL with up and down zooms, and A resets the

58
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
view.

59
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:26,533
L picks which screen the theme is for; the default is the HOME Menu.

60
00:03:26,533 --> 00:03:28,533
X sets the name, Y the author.

61
00:03:28,533 --> 00:03:30,533
Press Plus, Generate Theme.

62
00:03:30,533 --> 00:03:33,200
The theme is saved to the themes folder.

63
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:35,467
On the Theme Created Successfully!

64
00:03:35,467 --> 00:03:40,467
screen, hold A for three seconds to install it, or Y to install and reboot.

65
00:03:40,467 --> 00:03:46,000
Remove an installed theme in NXThemes Installer: in the left column open "Uninstall

66
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,000
theme".

67
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:53,600
"Remove the current theme" brings back the default theme, and "Uninstall everything"

68
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,600
removes it all.

69
00:03:55,600 --> 00:04:00,867
And remember: every firmware install removes custom themes, because a theme for

70
00:04:00,867 --> 00:04:04,267
another firmware can stop the console from booting.

71
00:04:04,267 --> 00:04:07,000
Install the theme again after the update.

72
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:12,067
The look of Kefir Hub itself is set separately: Settings, Appearance, Theme.

73
00:04:12,067 --> 00:04:15,067
This does not change the console's HOME Menu.

74
00:04:15,067 --> 00:04:19,267
Read more on the Cheats and Themes pages of the Kefir Hub docs.
